  "question": {
    "text": "Let the vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;be co-planar. Then which of the following is true?"
